// Tests: for current N times stage with deal-to-all quantifier
// 3 players, deal 1 card to each → each Hand has 1 card
player P1, P2, P3
turnorder all
location Hand on all
location Deck on table
card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three)
    for Suite(Diamonds)
shuffle Deck

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal 1 from top(Deck) private to Hand of all
  cycle to next
  end stage
}
